      "description": "Watch Internacional vs Flamengo highlights and goals from Brasileirão on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on July 30, 2026. High expectations surrounded the Serie A clash between Internacional and Flamengo on July 30, 2026. As two of Brazil's football giants took to the pitch, the match promised a strategic battle between teams desperate to climb the league table. Internacional Seize the Initiative Internacional started the contest with intent, looking to capitalize on their home advantage. The breakthrough arrived in the 27th minute when Vitinho found the back of the net with a clinical finish. The goal sent the home supporters into a frenzy and forced Flamengo to rethink their approach. For the remainder of the first half, the hosts remained disciplined, thwarting several attempts from the visitors to find an equalizer before the halftime whistle. Flamengo's Tactical Shifts Pay Off The second half saw a different narrative as Flamengo introduced fresh legs, including Erick Pulgar and Danilo , to alter the momentum. Their persistence eventually bore fruit in the 79th minute. Bruno Henrique , acting as a super-sub, provided a brilliant assist for Samuel Lino , who calmly slotted the ball home to level the score at 1-1. The equalizer set up a grandstand finish as both sides pushed for a decisive late winner. Late Drama and Discipline As the clock ticked deep into stoppage time, the intensity boiled over, resulting in a flurry of bookings. Vitao had already seen yellow earlier, but the closing moments saw Erick Pulgar , Gabriel Mercado , and Nicolas de la Cruz all enter the referee's book. Despite a series of late substitutions intended to find a breakthrough, neither side could find the finishing touch. The referee finally brought the proceedings to a close after 98 minutes, with both teams earning a hard-fought point."
