      "description": "Watch Cruzeiro vs Flamengo highlights and goals from Brasileirão on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 23, 2026. Late drama defines a tactical battle in Serie A On August 23, 2026 , the Serie A match between Cruzeiro and Flamengo proved to be an unpredictable affair, characterized by shifting momentum and intense competitive spirit. Both sides fought tooth and nail throughout the evening to secure a pivotal result in the heart of the Brazilian championship. Flamengo strikes first The visitors set the tone early in the match, asserting their attacking intent with fluid transitions. Their efforts were rewarded in the 22nd minute when a precise ball from Giorgian De Arrascaeta found Pedro , who slotted the opener home. While the match saw cards for both teams, including a booking for Fabricio Bruno , Flamengo maintained their composure to head into the break with a slender lead. The Cruzeiro resurgence The complexion of the game changed significantly after the interval as Cruzeiro increased their offensive pressure. Their breakthrough came in the 55th minute, with Keny Arroyo finding the back of the net following a well-weighted assist from Matheus Henrique . The equalizer sparked a flurry of tactical adjustments, with both managers looking to the bench for fresh legs to break the stalemate in the final stages of the second half. A finish for the history books The closing minutes were defined by pure determination. Deep into injury time, at the 90+5 minute mark, Lucas Villalba delivered a crucial assist to Matheus Pereira . With clinical precision, Pereira scored the match-winning goal, handing Cruzeiro a thrilling 2-1 victory and leaving the visiting side with no time to recover."
